## Professional UI Patterns

- **Shell:** desktop left rail (`features/dashboard/components/shell/AppRail`); below 1024px a top bar plus bottom tab bar. Five destinations: Home, Bills, Statements, Cards, Settings. Cross-module actions (Run SOA, Upload receipt, Add card) come from `useQuickActions()`.
- **Page header:** `DashboardPageHeader` with optional `breadcrumb`, `actions` (one primary, the rest in a `MoreHorizontal` menu), and `meta` (`FigureLine`).
- **Lists before grids:** bills, statements, and cards are ruled rows inside one panel (`divide-y rounded-lg border bg-card`). Never nest panels.
- **Dialogs:** `DialogContent` is a bottom sheet below 640px and a centered dialog above. Long forms (card add/edit) use a right `Sheet` with sectioned `fieldset`s and a sticky save bar.
- **Empty states:** what's missing + the one action that fills it (`EmptyState`). **Errors:** `ErrorState` with retry.
- **Loading:** skeletons from `components/shared/skeletons` that match the final layout; no centered spinners for page content.
- **Motion:** 120–200ms state feedback; month change `kame-sheet-in`; mark-paid pen stroke via `DayMark animate`; deep-link `kame-arrive`. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Accessibility Checklist

### Color Contrast

```typescript
// Ensure sufficient contrast ratios (WCAG 2.1 AA)
// Normal text: 4.5:1 minimum
// Large text: 3:1 minimum

// Good - High contrast
<p className="text-foreground">Main content</p>
<p className="text-muted-foreground">Secondary content</p>

// Avoid low contrast text
// ❌ <p className="text-gray-300">Hard to read</p>
```

### Focus Management

```typescript
// Visible focus indicators
<button className="
  focus-visible:outline-none 
  focus-visible:ring-2 
  focus-visible:ring-ring 
  focus-visible:ring-offset-2
">

// Skip to main content
<a
  href="#main-content"
  className="
    sr-only focus:not-sr-only
    focus:absolute focus:top-4 focus:left-4
    focus:z-50 focus:p-4 focus:bg-background
  "
>
  Skip to main content
</a>

// Focus trap in modals
import { FocusTrap } from '@headlessui/react';

<Dialog>
  <FocusTrap>
    <DialogContent>...</DialogContent>
  </FocusTrap>
</Dialog>
```

### Screen Reader Support

```typescript
// Announce dynamic content
import { useEffect } from 'react';

export function useAnnounce() {
  const announce = (message: string) => {
    const el = document.createElement('div');
    el.setAttribute('aria-live', 'polite');
    el.setAttribute('aria-atomic', 'true');
    el.className = 'sr-only';
    el.textContent = message;
    document.body.appendChild(el);
    setTimeout(() => el.remove(), 1000);
  };
  
  return announce;
}

// Usage
const announce = useAnnounce();
const handleSave = async () => {
  await save();
  announce('Changes saved successfully');
};
```

## Design Checklist

Before shipping UI, verify:

### Theme Support (CRITICAL - Check First!)
- [ ] **Light mode**: Renders correctly with proper colors
- [ ] **Dark mode**: Renders correctly with proper colors
- [ ] **No hardcoded colors**: Uses CSS variables or dark: variants
- [ ] **Contrast ratios**: Text readable in BOTH themes (4.5:1)

### Responsive Design
- [ ] **Responsive**: Works on mobile (320px) to desktop (1920px+)
- [ ] **Touch-friendly**: Touch targets ≥ 44x44px

### States & Feedback
- [ ] **Loading states**: Skeleton loaders for async content
- [ ] **Error states**: Clear, actionable error messages
- [ ] **Empty states**: Helpful guidance when no data
- [ ] **Feedback**: User actions have immediate feedback

### Accessibility
- [ ] **Keyboard navigation**: All interactive elements focusable
- [ ] **Focus indicators**: Visible focus states in both themes
- [ ] **Reduced motion**: Respects `prefers-reduced-motion`
- [ ] **Semantic HTML**: Proper heading hierarchy and landmarks

### Visual Quality
- [ ] **Performance**: No layout shifts (CLS), fast interactions
- [ ] **Consistent spacing**: Uses design system spacing scale
- [ ] **Visual hierarchy**: Clear content structure
- [ ] **Shadows work**: Shadows visible and appropriate in both themes
